                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I'd recommend it to those who like meticulously micromanaging a fleet and multiple space colonies.  I found it felt like 'work' after a while, and the early game has to be set up just right or you will have to start over.  If old-style management games that offer a challenge are your thing you should like it. There is a very detailed walkthrough available on-line.  \r\n\r\nAll that being said I only spent 1.50 and am fine with having tried out this retro game. The storyline looks like it probably gets interesting later on, if you have the patience to do the early game set up.  It's a high quality game, made for a certain type of player.",
